This is guitar lesson of Hosanna Guitar Chords with Strumming Pattern from the bollywood movie Ek Deewana Tha. Sung by Leon D'Souza and Suzanne D'Mello.

It's a Bollywood Hindi romantic drama movie directed by Gautham Menon, featuring Prateik Babbar and Amy Jackson.

Strumming Pattern : DD UDUD

